Thomas B. Dozeman, *The Pentateuch: Introducing the Torah* (Fortress, 2017), on the Meribah traditions
Eugene H. Merrill, *Deuteronomy* (New American Commentary; B&H, 1994), on Deuteronomy 3:26-27
