Donald A. Hagner, *Matthew 14-28* (WBC 33B; Word, 1995), pp. 464-472, on Matthew 16:16-17
Martin Hengel, *Saint Peter: The Underestimated Apostle*, trans. Thomas H. Trapp (Eerdmans, 2010), pp. 13-34, on Peter traditions across the Gospels
