W. D. Davies and Dale C. Allison, *A Critical and Exegetical Commentary on the Gospel According to Saint Matthew* (ICC, vol. 3; T&T Clark, 1997), pp. 484-486, on Matt 26:34
Joseph A. Fitzmyer, *The Gospel According to Luke X-XXIV* (AB 28A; Doubleday, 1985), pp. 1421-1424, on Luke 22:34
Raymond E. Brown, *The Gospel According to John (XIII-XXI)* (AB 29A; Doubleday, 1970), pp. 614-616, on John 13:38
