Joseph A. Fitzmyer, *The Gospel According to Luke X-XXIV* (AB 28A; Garden City, NY: Doubleday, 1985), pp. 1496-1499, on Luke 23:26.
D. A. Carson, *The Gospel According to John* (PNTC; Grand Rapids: Eerdmans, 1991), pp. 609-611, on John 19:17.
