D. A. Carson, *The Gospel According to John* (PNTC; Eerdmans, 1991), pp. 603-605, on the dual-reckoning hypothesis.
Andreas J. Köstenberger, *John* (BECNT; Baker Academic, 2004), pp. 537-540.
