W. D. Davies and Dale C. Allison, *A Critical and Exegetical Commentary on the Gospel According to Saint Matthew* (ICC; T&T Clark, 1997), vol. 3, pp. 620-625.
François Bovon, *Luke 3: A Commentary on the Gospel of Luke 19:28-24:53*, trans. James Crouch (Hermeneia; Fortress, 2012), pp. 326-331, on Luke 23:46.
