Joseph A. Fitzmyer, *The Acts of the Apostles* (AB 31; Doubleday, 1998), pp. 509-518, on Acts 13:27-29.
John Dominic Crossan, *Who Killed Jesus? Exposing the Roots of Anti-Semitism in the Gospel Story of the Death of Jesus* (HarperSanFrancisco, 1995), pp. 160-188.
Bart D. Ehrman, *How Jesus Became God: The Exaltation of a Jewish Preacher from Galilee* (HarperOne, 2014), pp. 151-169.
